/target
**/target
result
result-*
.direnv
__pycache__
.claude/settings.local.json

# Backlog.md task tracking is local working state, not repository content.
# Other backlog/ material (decisions, docs, milestones) stays tracked.
backlog/tasks/

# Recorded and generated audio under scratch/. The scripts that produce and
# consume it are tracked; the waveforms themselves are large, regenerable
# (`make_click_track.py`) or machine-specific captures.
#
# Corpus work writes outside the repository entirely, so nothing below should
# ever match. It is here so that a stray `curl` into `scratch/` is a no-op
# rather than a licensing incident: the rule is "no corpus audio and no corpus
# archive in this repository", and a rule only enforced by care is a habit.
scratch/**/*.wav
scratch/**/*.flac
scratch/**/*.mp3
scratch/**/*.m4a
scratch/**/*.ogg
scratch/**/*.oga
scratch/**/*.opus
scratch/**/*.aif
scratch/**/*.aiff
scratch/**/*.au
scratch/**/*.caf
scratch/**/*.tar
scratch/**/*.tar.gz
scratch/**/*.tgz
scratch/**/*.zip
